42
00:01:57,012 --> 00:01:59,938
On day two you answer the question every N

43
00:01:59,938 --> 00:02:01,958
O C asks first. What changed?

44
00:02:01,958 --> 00:02:04,535
You pull audit logs from the devices,

45
00:02:04,535 --> 00:02:09,411
