51
00:02:24,806 --> 00:02:28,637
No citation, no conclusion. And the severity rules live

52
00:02:28,637 --> 00:02:31,006
in code, so a sync failure in an H

53
00:02:31,006 --> 00:02:33,444
A pair is never quietly downgraded.

54
00:02:34,194 --> 00:02:37,625
Next, the ticket. Through the ServiceNow Table A P

55
00:02:37,625 --> 00:02:40,644
I the pipeline looks up the open incident by

56
00:02:40,644 --> 00:02:43,800
correlation I D, decides whether to update it,

57
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,858
