103
00:05:00,696 --> 00:05:04,868
Every build in this course follows six engineering principles.

104
00:05:04,868 --> 00:05:06,684
Model output is a proposal,

105
00:05:06,684 --> 00:05:10,183
never a fact. Authorization lives outside the model.

106
00:05:10,183 --> 00:05:13,143
A human approves every consequential action.

107
00:05:13,143 --> 00:05:15,431
Decisions and evidence are logged.

108
00:05:15,431 --> 00:05:19,401
The stack stays provider-agnostic. And quality is measured,

109
00:05:19,401 --> 00:05:20,208
not assumed.

110
00:05:20,958 --> 00:05:23,274
Eleven build steps. Three days,

111
00:05:23,274 --> 00:05:26,261
hands-on. Five device platforms covered.

112
00:05:26,261 --> 00:05:28,278
And zero duplicate tickets.

113
